     "heading": "Input",
     "html": "<p>Barrier Intelligence (oil &amp; gas safety). &quot;To ship faster, we're going to outsource the alert-labelling to a data vendor and license a third-party gas-safety rules library instead of writing our own. That way we inherit everything and just build the app. Good plan?&quot;</p>\n<p>Evidence available: field logs from rigs and permit data are the raw corpus <span class=\"tag tag-fact\">Fact</span>; the labelled alert dataset is what would train and evaluate the detector <span class=\"tag tag-fact\">Fact</span>; the safety thresholds are the domain judgment that makes the product trustworthy <span class=\"tag tag-assumption\">Assumption</span>.</p>"
